{"id": "1541292388847452172", "channel_id": "1541292388847452172", "author_id": "792347624442560512", "author_name": "sum1_nyx.", "content": "如題\n想請教一下大佬們融災以我現在的喚醒體可以怎樣配隊，或是需要繼續補什麼角色跟命輪，了解後會培養角色試試看的\n\n還有想順便請大佬們幫我看一下現在我常用的兩個陣容有哪些需要改進的地方\n\n謝謝<:Horla_cry:1357186646294138890>", "timestamp": "2026-08-24T03:45:41.329000+00:00", "thread_id": "1541292388847452172", "attachments": [{"id": "1541292389543710881", "filename": "Screenshot_20260824_113156_Morimens.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 162183, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1541292388847452172/1541292389543710881/Screenshot_20260824_113156_Morimens.jpg?ex=6a8d0fe5&is=6a8bbe65&hm=41f4e2e584cf8e431f415913140cacb51b40f6ceabb9330bbca05ff441475d28&"}, {"id": "1541292390017671229", "filename": "Screenshot_20260824_113208_Morimens.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 156641, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1541292388847452172/1541292390017671229/Screenshot_20260824_113208_Morimens.jpg?ex=6a8d0fe5&is=6a8bbe65&hm=82a3970958db72ecad4bc2f23151d47772f7942957114652c138206bb282d6c0&"}, {"id": "1541292390424252437", "filename": "Screenshot_20260824_113232_Morimens.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 197630, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1541292388847452172/1541292390424252437/Screenshot_20260824_113232_Morimens.jpg?ex=6a8d0fe5&is=6a8bbe65&hm=d9316d80667ce6ec4fe041d753f5efa922fcbedafb9424cfa3e8046920de15be&"}, {"id": "1541292390839492738", "filename": "Screenshot_20260824_113239_Morimens.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 195294, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1541292388847452172/1541292390839492738/Screenshot_20260824_113239_Morimens.jpg?ex=6a8d0fe5&is=6a8bbe65&hm=fb03d77adc52fcdd92c136b09857bf2dfb28efd7136bd338bde4415ab26e61bb&"}, {"id": "1541292391384743966", "filename": "Screenshot_20260824_113249_Morimens.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 180681, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1541292388847452172/15412923